---
# var-naming[no-role-prefix] wants every role variable prefixed with its
# own role's name (e.g. secretweb_app_install_dir). Deliberately not
# followed here: secretweb_app/secretweb_pki/secretweb_service all
# describe the *same* environment (see playbooks/provision_environment.yml)
# and intentionally share one flat secretweb_* variable namespace across
# all three, so e.g. secretweb_install_dir means the same thing everywhere
# instead of being redefined three times under three different prefixes.
skip_list:
  - var-naming[no-role-prefix]
